  "code": "def fib(n, bellek):\n    if n in bellek:\n        return bellek[n]\n    if n < 2:\n        return n\n    sonuc = fib(n - 1, bellek) + fib(n - 2, bellek)\n    bellek[n] = sonuc\n    return sonuc\n\n\nonbellek = {}\nsonuc = fib(5, onbellek)\nprint(sonuc, onbellek)",
